H29 sign pass A (Opus vision, 28 Sept 2026, prompt scripts/PROMPTS.md "H29 sign passes"). Rows verbatim except the segment column, given as s1..s4 by the reader and stored as 1..4 for tools/reconcile_passes.py. Its warning, verbatim: "4 pairs of segment images are byte-identical, checked by md5: L03_s4=L04_s4, L04_s2=L05_s2, L05_s4=L06_s4, L06_s1=L07_s1. The slope-following crop broke for bands L04-L07 ... L04 is missing s2 and s4 ... L05 is missing s2 and s4 ... L06 is missing s4 ... L07 is missing s1 ... L04 and L05 s1 also show the row sitting low and partly cut at the bottom edge. The bands need re-cutting before these rows are used." Also: "x_px: for s1-s3 it is in original pixels (displayed x times 1.35). For s4 it is displayed x". Counts: L01 34 (4 PLAIN + 30), L02 43, L03 42, L04 25, L05 23, L06 36, L07 31.
